    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2>Two decades after the cataclysm, the Church has created a zombie battlefield in the wasteland to select the best fighters. You can collect credits on the battlefield to unlock new characters and weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple characters, each with unique skill attributes.<br></li><li>Multiple special weapons, each with exclusive functions, allowing you to freely customize according to your preferences.<br></li><li>There is no limit to weapon attribute slots, meaning characters can endlessly level up.<br></li><li>Multiple diverse scenes, each featuring unique elite zombie monsters.</li></ul><br>How long can you survive and fight against hordes of zombies.",
